  "body": "We need some glue here for `:drop` and `:drop()` pseudo-classes, so it's well-defined when they apply for HTML.\n\nhttps://drafts.csswg.org/selectors-4/#drag-pseudos\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/scripting.html#pseudo-classes\n\nI think these are not yet implemented though?\nhttp://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/saved/4518\n",
